    <Property ID="1" Name="journal table" EvaluationPeriod="P2D">rows of statements &quot;SELECT pkg_name,ACTION,info,time_action,current_status FROM journal&quot; of sqlite databases of files &quot;pim.db&quot; of folders &quot;Common Files\Adobe\OOBE\PDApp&quot; of folders whose(name of it as lowercase starts with &quot;program files&quot;) of root folder of drive of system folder</Property>
